---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const essentialsRepo =
	"https://github.com/Manurocker95/Pokemon-Essentials-21-With-Unofficial-EBDX";
---

<Base
	title="Asset credits"
	description="Licenses for the interactive home scene graphics."
>
	<article class="credits">
		<h1>Asset credits</h1>
		<p>
			The home room uses <strong>Pokémon Essentials</strong> graphics from a local
			copy of{" "}
			<a href={essentialsRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">
				Pokémon Essentials 21 with Unofficial EBDX
			</a>
			, imported via <code>pnpm import:essentials</code>. See{" "}
			<a href="https://github.com/Manurocker95/Pokemon-Essentials-21-With-Unofficial-EBDX">
				the asset repository
			</a>{" "}
			and <code>docs/ASSETS.md</code>.
		</p>

		<h2>Pokémon Essentials (local only)</h2>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Source</strong> —{" "}
				<a href={essentialsRepo} rel="noopener noreferrer">
					github.com/Manurocker95/Pokemon-Essentials-21-With-Unofficial-EBDX
				</a>
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Tilesets</strong> — Poké Center interior, interiors, outside (
				<code>Graphics/Tilesets/</code>).
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Player</strong> — <code>trainer_POKEMONTRAINER_Red</code> (boy),
				<code>trainer_POKEMONTRAINER_Leaf</code> (girl) (
				<code>Graphics/Characters/</code>).
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Props</strong> — PC, counter, healing machine, plant, door (cropped
				from tilesets).
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>UI</strong> — on-screen control hints (
				<code>Graphics/UI/Controls help/</code>).
			</li>
		</ul>
		<p>
			These assets are <em>not</em> redistributed in the PokeBlog repository. Obtain
			them from the link above and keep them in gitignored <code>recursos/</code> on
			your machine. Pokémon and related trademarks are property of Nintendo /
			Creatures / GAME FREAK.
		</p>

		<h2>Multi-tile objects</h2>
		<p>
			Each object has a <code>footprint</code> in tiles (width×height). Origin is
			top-left; collision covers all footprint cells.
		</p>

		<p><a href="/">Back to room</a> · <a href="/posts">Posts</a></p>
	</article>
</Base>

<style>
	.credits {
		max-width: var(--content-width, 680px);
		margin: 2rem auto;
		padding: 0 1rem 3rem;
	}
	.credits h1 {
		font-size: 1.75rem;
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
	}
	.credits h2 {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		font-size: 1.15rem;
	}
</style>
